              =0 {Your administrator asks that you relaunch Browther to apply this update}
              =1 {Your administrator asks that you relaunch Browther to apply this update. Your Private window won't reopen.}
              other {Your administrator asks that you relaunch Browther to apply this update. Your # Private windows won't reopen.}}</translation>
